  "section_notes": "The final text bars nothing outright in S2: above-5% models may keep selling through a 6-month retest window and sales restrictions are discretionary. S3 gives new units 24 months rather than 12, and S5 makes recall mandatory at 8 per 100,000 with no transition, which would capture the Ember 8 at 9.9. Per-model results go to customers and regulators but are not published publicly, satisfying both disclosure red lines."
